+
+# Give each task a unique id
+
+The app needs a stable way to refer to a task that survives a rename.
+
+- `add` returns a task with an `id`: a string no other task of the list has.
+- The list gets `get(id)`, returning the task as a `Result`, like the other methods.
+- `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept a task's id as well as its title.
+- Ids are deterministic (a per-list counter): the domain uses no clock or randomness.
